---
import Card from "./Card/index.astro";
---

<Card colSpan="md:col-span-1" rowSpan="md:row-span-6" title="About me">
  <div class="flex flex-col h-full gap-2 overflow-y-auto scroll-hide">
    <div class="text-sm font-light">
      <p>
        Hi, I'm Zain, a front-end software developer from China.
        <br />
        My primary tools of choice includes:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside">
        <li>JavaScript</li>
        <li>React</li>
        <li>Vue</li>
        <li>Nodejs</li>
        <li>擅长 Ai、Fw、Fl、Br、Ae、Pr、Id、Ps 等软件的安装与卸载</li>
        <li>精通 Windows、Linux、MacOS系统的开关机</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <p class="text-sm font-light tab">
      Beyond coding, I'm passionate about design, illustration, animation and 3D
      modelling and traveling. An unusual hobby of mine is collecting vintage
      passports, they're interesting pieces of history to me.
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm font-light tab">
      While I have some preferred tools, I always choose the best one for the
      job, even if it's not on my usual list. My goal is to find the right
      solution for each project.
    </p>
  </div>
</Card>

<style>
  .scroll-hide {
    /* 隐藏滚动条 - WebKit 浏览器（Chrome、Edge 等） */
    &::-webkit-scrollbar {
      display: none;
    }

    /* 隐藏滚动条 - Firefox */
    scrollbar-width: none;

    /* 隐藏滚动条 - IE/Edge（旧版） */
    -ms-overflow-style: none;
  }
  .tab {
    text-indent: 1em;
  }
</style>
